# An allowlist: the image needs only the package, its lock and the smoke test. Everything else stays out of the build
# context, above all secrets (.env, pipeline.local.toml), the virtual environment and data.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!scripts/smoke_test.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
